{title: Kuchh To Log Kahenge}
{artist: Kishore Kumar R D Burman}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]kuchh to log kahenge,
[C]logon ka kaam hai kahanaa
[C]chhoDo bekar [Am]ki baaton mein
[F]kahin beet [A#]naa jae raina
[C]kuch reet jagata [F]ki aisi hai
[C]har ek [F]subaha ki [C]shyam hui
[C]tU kaun hai [F]tera naam hai kya
[C]sita bhi [A#]yaha badnam hui
[C]phira kyu sansar [Am]ki baaton se
[F]bhig gaye [A#]tere nayana
[C]kuchha to log kahenge,
[C]logon kaa kaam hai kahanaa
